<!-- ◆ THE BRIEF -->
<div class="ename"><div class="wrap"><span class="en">◆ THE BRIEF</span><span class="eu">the opener on paper · kicker + display heading + services list left, lede right · pull .paper .story</span></div></div>
<section class="paper"><div class="wrap story">
  <div class="side">
    <span class="k mono">\ The brief</span>
    <h2>Make a health brand feel like the people it <span class="serif">serves.</span></h2>
    <ul class="svc"><li><i>✳</i>Pitch strategy</li><li><i>✳</i>Casting + concept</li><li><i>✳</i>Creative direction</li><li><i>✳</i>Edit</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <p>When OMEK went after Blue Cross of Idaho, they brought me in to help structure the pitch. We won it. The ask: a campaign that looked like Blue Cross's actual customers.</p>
    <p>Real people, everyday moments, in the places Idahoans actually live. The whole job was keeping it from looking like a health-insurance ad.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

